WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.460
- So, how did you find
out about "Ms. Marvel"?

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.900
- WhatsApp.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.830
- Is that real?

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:07.110
- Yeah, my aunt was part of...

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.430
- Your life right now, okay, keep going.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.749
- Dude, it's crazy.

00:00:09.749 --> 00:00:11.550
My aunt was part of a group
chat that she never opens.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.650
One day she decided to, and
there was the "Ms. Marvel"

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.577
casting call, and it was a blank page.

00:00:15.577 --> 00:00:17.790
"Ms. Marvel," send headshot
and resume to this email.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.708
Super sketchy, so obviously I did it.

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:22.290
(Kelly chuckling)

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.120
But no, I was a huge "Ms.
Marvel" fan in high school.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.080
I read all the comics.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.340
I was a Marvel nerd.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.050
My entire life surrounded Marvel,

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.390
and now people actually have
to listen when I talk about it,

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.320
'cause I work for it.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.790
- Oh my God, you get paid for it now.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.623
It's amazing.

00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:34.800
- But yeah.
- That's awesome though,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.080
that you always loved it, and
then you get your first role

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.970
is something that you loved as a kid.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.710
You're still a kid to me, but yeah,

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.690
I was like, I could be your mom.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:43.523
Look we can...
- Wow,

00:00:43.523 --> 00:00:45.183
how do you get a career online?

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:47.183
That's amazing.

00:00:47.183 --> 00:00:48.248
Your aunt went online.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:49.081
- [Kelly] Oh, musicians do it daily, yeah.

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:51.810
- WhatsApp, and it was like
this is the brownest way

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:52.710
this could have happened.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:55.606
For South Asians, WhatsApp is our home.

00:00:55.606 --> 00:00:58.575
(all laughing)

00:00:58.575 --> 00:01:00.683
- It's our home.
- It's Costco and Whatsapp.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:05.753
- You're funny too.
(audience applauding)

